    "code": "bool alarm = false;\nvoid setup() { Serial.begin(115200); pinMode(9, OUTPUT); }\nvoid loop() {\n  int reading = analogRead(A0);\n  bool next = alarm;\n  if (reading >= 700) next = true;\n  if (reading <= 300) next = false;\n  if (next != alarm) {\n    alarm = next;\n    digitalWrite(9, alarm);\n    Serial.println(alarm ? \"ON\" : \"OFF\");\n  }\n}\n",
